        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Khia, Khia Shamone Finch, Khia Shamone Chambers\n- Products: Love Locs\n- Organizations: Thug Misses Entertainment\n- Roles: rapper, songwriter, singer, record producer\n\nFacts:\n- Khia Shamone Finch was born as Khia Shamone Chambers on November 8, 1970.\n- Khia is an American rapper, songwriter, singer, and record producer.\n- Love Locs is the fifth studio album by American hip hop artist Khia.\n- Love Locs was released digitally on July 4, 2014.\n- Love Locs was released on Khia's own label, Thug Misses Entertainment.",
